        "standfirst": "Ipswich Town drew 1-1 with Nottingham Forest, levelling after falling behind to an early opener.",
        "account": "Forest went ahead in the 13th minute when Daniel Muñoz crossed and Neco Williams met it right-footed inside the box, his finish going into the middle of the goal. Ipswich came from behind just before half-time, Julio Enciso sending a left-footed shot from outside the box low into the corner. Williams went off injured six minutes from time.",
